  "meta": {
    "about": "CadCraft only. A 280 × 900 mm bookcase side with two columns of 5 mm shelf-pin holes on the 32 mm system, 37 mm in from each edge, dimensioned and labelled on separate layers. The DWG is true scale, for a CNC or for tiling a 1:1 print from a CAD program; the PDF and PNG are fitted to the page as a shop drawing (the 100 mm bar shows the scale of any printout). Change the panel size or pitch in the nodes to fit your cabinet; the hole count comes out as JSON as a check.",
    "tags": [
      "woodwork",
      "fabrication"
    ],
    "title": "Shelf-pin drilling template"
  },
